      "sourceTextSha256": "5dcec1477d0487b7460ccd0cd6e8c50fc43c937d3dce2b580e406f2cc3decf52",
      "text": "After breakfast, take a private transfer to the airport for your Aerolíneas Argentinas flight to Iguazú via Buenos Aires. On arrival, meet your representative and take the scheduled transfer to Hotel Mercure Iguazú Irú.\n\nThis is primarily a travel day as the scenery changes from Patagonia’s glaciers to the humid subtropical forests of Misiones. The guided programme at the waterfalls begins the following morning.",
